-ring/three-stone-trillion-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-rose-gold-1-3-ct-tw-item-203662?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$3,255</a></td><td>Our trillion pick. Classic three-stone.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Triple Row Pavé Cathedral (JA)</strong></td><td>Triple-Row Pavé Cathedral</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/triple-row-pave-cathedral-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-rose-gold-by-james-allen-item-304959?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$3,085</a></td><td>Triple-row pavé + cathedral.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Romantic Floral Halo (1/2 ct., FLORAL PICK)</strong></td><td>Victorian Floral Halo</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/romantic-diamond-floral-halo-engagement-ring-in-14k-rose-gold-1-2-ct-tw-item-150341?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$3,655</a></td><td>Our floral pick. Romantic Victorian halo.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Art Deco Hexagon Halo (Zac Posen, 3/4 ct.)</strong></td><td>Art Deco Hexagonal Halo</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/zac-zac-posen-art-deco-hexagon-halo-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-rose-gold-3-4-ct-tw-item-203817?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$4,175</a></td><td>1920s hexagon Art Deco.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>East West Marquise Side Stone (JA)</strong></td><td>East-West Marquise Side Stones</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/east-west-marquise-cut-side-stone-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-rose-gold-by-james-allen-item-316328?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$4,205</a></td><td>East-west marquise + side stones.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Three-Stone Pear Halo</strong></td><td>Pear Halo Three-Stone</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/three-stone-p